[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6091328618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124314#issuecomment-6091328618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124314","id":6091328618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaxJMag","user":{"login":"DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T23:59:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T23:59:17Z","body":"[Perfetto traces](https://drive.google.com/file/d/13pU_R2GuiQUkwPRK0jR8wHWaDVSvIfP8/view?usp=sharing)\n\nsafe:  <img width=\"1312\" height=\"158\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a89d3719-2191-44e4-8ae6-cdfb22098f95\" />\n\nseparate: <img width=\"1659\" height=\"205\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8edee0f8-b894-4a6d-981e-4bbed0087df0\" />\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6091328618/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6093581589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124314#issuecomment-6093581589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124314","id":6093581589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABazStFQ","user":{"login":"DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T04:04:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T04:04:59Z","body":"The OpenXR spec [states](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/xrBeginFrame.html):\n\n> Runtimes must not perform frame synchronization or throttling through the [xrBeginFrame](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/xrBeginFrame.html) function and should instead do so through [xrWaitFrame](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/xrWaitFrame.html).\n\nIt seems to me like the valve runtime is breaking that by making the call to `xrBeginFrame` block, though I'm certainly no expert here.\n\nI experimented with a hacky fix to call `xrBeginFrame` immediately after `xrWaitFrame` on the same thread, and it certainly seems to work around the issue: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...DanielKinsman:godot:hack-xr-begin-frame","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6093581589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6204597503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124314#issuecomment-6204597503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124314","id":6204597503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcdKk_w","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T23:42:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T23:42:17Z","body":"cc @Kimau is this similar to the issue that you discovered some time ago?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6204597503/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6213161501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124314#issuecomment-6213161501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124314","id":6213161501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABclVSHQ","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T10:09:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:09:12Z","body":"Yeah hit it while doing the frame port. \nIts on my roadmap to rewrite some sync logic stuff but delaying until I finished the PS5 renderer rewrite as that gives me a stronger direction for where I want to head.\n\nBest practice is not fully agreed on by all the runtimes but the core thing is waitFrame really is your Input Sync point so the later you can call it the better. Then do a late latch with the renderer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6213161501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]